# MUST BE INCONSISTENT: hasOperatorTarget has range ProcessOperator,
# and ProcessOperator is disjoint with TechnicalResource.
@prefix vdi3682: <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/vdi3682#> .
@prefix ex: <https://w3id.org/aias/example/neg#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
<https://w3id.org/aias/example/neg04> a owl:Ontology ; owl:imports <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/vdi3682/2.0.0> .
ex:F a vdi3682:Flow ; vdi3682:hasOperatorTarget ex:R .
ex:R a vdi3682:TechnicalResource .
